he 'train-scope-substring' case where the required scope 'read:items' is not correctly identified as present in the granted scope 'read:items:admin' due to substring matching.","expected_effect":"The solution should ensure that the exact scope is matched without substring matches. This can be achieved by splitting the granted scopes into a list, checking if the required scope is exactly in that list.","schema_version":"exp002-diagnosis-update/v1","updates":{"harness.py":"def has_scope(granted, required) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return whether a comma-separated grant contains the exact scope.\"\"\"\n    return required == granted.split(',')[0].strip() if granted.count(',') == 0 else required in [s.strip() for s in granted.split(',')]  # This is a simplified version for exact match without substring"}},"tool_calls":[],"usage":[{"agent_id":null,"agent_scope":"unknown","cached_input_tokens":0,"configured_settings":{"num_ctx":4096,"num_predict":1200,"seed":42,"temperature":0,"think":false},"duration_seconds":43.33512230007909,"error_type":null,"input_token_semantics":"unknown","input_tokens":454,"model":"qwen3:4b","output_tokens":272,"provider_ai_credits":null,"provider_correlation_id":null,"provider_cost":null,"provider_cost_unit":null,"provider_metadata":{"done_reason":"stop"},"provider_nano_aiu":null,"provider_reported_input_tokens":null,"provider_reported_total_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"reported_settings":{},"role":"optimizer","status":"success","total_tokens":726,"total_tokens_is_inferred":false,"uncached_input_tokens":454,"usage_incomplete":false}]},"result_artifact":{"bytes":3257,"kind":"session-result","sha256":"sha256:7394fb09beeb715c0553fc848b641934374cecf6ceda4f5a7d27d45589fc85a7","uri":"sessions/e4635df393cfaaa7688652bb805aa2b630e332b385f61290614147d58f308b68/result.json"},"session_id":"sha256:e4635df393cfaaa7688652bb805aa2b630e332b385f61290614147d58f308b68","stage":"proposal.patch","wall_seconds":43.39000000001397},"run_id":"exp002-v4-permission_scopes-q